第 7 页 · Experimental design
目标：30 秒
We use BIPIA EmailQA for our experiment.
We chose all settings using development data, not test data. Then we tested 300 attacks from 15 types and three positions, plus 50 clean emails.
We measure three things: attack success, answer retention, and accuracy on clean emails.
We also use paired McNemar tests to check the differences.

中文：
我们使用 BIPIA EmailQA 进行实验。
所有参数都在开发集上确定，而不是测试集。然后测试 300 个攻击样本和 50 封干净邮件。
我们评估三个指标：攻击成功率、答案保留率和干净邮件准确率，并使用配对 McNemar 检验。
第 8 页 · Main results
目标：55 秒
Here are our main results.
Without defence, 30 attacks succeed. Keyword filtering has 29, and per-chunk PIGuard reduces this to 15.
Adding context reduces attacks to just 1, but keeps only 93 out of 120 answers.
Our method has 2 successful attacks, but keeps 108 answers. The security difference is not significant, but the 15-answer improvement is significant, with p around 0.0001.
Whole-email filtering blocks all attacks, but keeps only 8 answers.
On clean emails, all methods have similar accuracy, between 35 and 37 out of 50.

中文：
没有防御时，30 次攻击成功。关键词过滤为 29 次，逐块 PIGuard 降到 15 次。
加入上下文后，攻击降到 1 次，但只能保留 93 个答案。
我们的方法有 2 次攻击成功，但保留了 108 个答案。安全性差异不显著，但答案保留的差异显著，p 约为 0.0001。
整封邮件过滤虽然阻止全部攻击，但只保留 8 个答案。
所有方法在干净邮件上的准确率相近。
第 9 页 · Security versus evidence
目标：35 秒
This figure shows the balance between security and answer retention.
Left means fewer attacks, and up means more answers kept. So the top-left is best.
Per-chunk PIGuard misses attacks. Risk-only methods lose useful answers. Whole-email filtering loses almost everything.
Only our method performs well on both.
We also tested different risk thresholds, from 0.01 to 0.999. None keeps more than 99 answers. This shows that relevance really helps.

中文：
这张图展示安全性与答案保留之间的平衡。
越靠左，攻击越少；越靠上，保留的答案越多。
逐块 PIGuard 会漏掉攻击。纯风险方法会损失答案。整封过滤几乎删除所有内容。
只有我们的方法在两个方面表现都很好。
我们还测试了不同的风险阈值，纯风险方法最多保留 99 个答案，说明相关度确实有效。
第 10 页 · Ablation study
目标：30 秒
This table shows what each part contributes.
Per-chunk detection reduces attacks from 30 to 15.
Adding context reduces them from 15 to 1, but loses 26 answers.
Adding relevance brings back 15 answers, with no significant security loss.
So both ideas work: context improves security, and relevance keeps useful evidence.
The keyword list and conflict term did not help.

中文：
这个表格展示每个部分的贡献。
逐块检测使攻击从 30 降到 15。
上下文使攻击从 15 降到 1，但损失了 26 个答案。
相关度恢复了 15 个答案，同时没有显著降低安全性。
因此两个想法都有效：上下文提高安全性，相关度保留证据。
关键词列表和冲突项没有帮助。
第 11 页 · Attack patterns and robustness
目标：25 秒
Most successful attacks try to change the answer format, such as using emojis, translation, or codes.
They often appear at the start of emails.
Short instructions are hard to detect, but context helps.
We also tested another BIPIA prompt template. The results followed the same pattern.
When we repeated the test, only 3 out of 300 labels changed.

中文：
成功的攻击主要尝试改变回答格式，比如 emoji、翻译或编码，通常出现在邮件开头。
短指令很难识别，但上下文有帮助。
另一种 BIPIA 提示模板得到相似的结果。
重复测试时，300 个标签中只有 3 个发生变化。
第 12 页 · Limitations
目标：35 秒
Our study has some limitations.
First, we tested only one task and one model. We need more tasks and models.
Second, we used fixed attacks. Future work should test attacks that can adapt to our method.
Third, our 72B judge answered "unknown" about 12% of the time. Human checks could help.
Finally, we remove whole chunks, which may lose useful text. More precise filtering could improve this.

中文：
我们的研究存在一些局限。
第一，只测试了一个任务和一个模型，需要进一步扩展。
第二，使用的是固定攻击，未来应该测试自适应攻击。
第三，72B 评判模型约有 12% 的回答为 UNKNOWN，需要人工检查。
最后，我们删除整个文本块，可能损失有用信息，更精确的过滤可以改善这个问题。
第 13 页 · Conclusion
目标：20 秒
To conclude, context helps us find attacks, and relevance helps us keep useful answers.
We should measure both security and answer retention.
Because blocking every attack is not useful if we also delete all the evidence.
Thank you for listening.
